        "commit_message": "We were trying to switch off some directives in the build (by changing the\n`default_directives` from `setup.py`) but weren't, at least not for parallel builds\nthat start separate Cython instances. The directives are now configured per\n`Extension` and explicitly in some modules that need (or should have) them.",
